<title>PHILIPPINES: BPI 1997 Q1 net at 1.45 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>BPI 1997 Q1 net at 1.45 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Philippine Islands said on Friday its net income in the first quarter of 1997 reached 1.45 billion pesos, up 122 percent from the year-ago figure.</p>
<p>The bank, which gave the January to March income in a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange, did not say how much the year-ago figure was.  </p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
